# Production build. Committed on purpose: nothing secret belongs here — it is baked into
# the browser bundle.
#
# Empty API/socket URLs = the page's own origin. That is the Hostinger / single-process
# layout, where the backend serves this bundle and /api and /socket.io from one port.
#
# For the split astrikos.xyz layout (DEPLOY.md), build with the backend subdomain set in
# the environment instead — real env vars override this file:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://erss-api.astrikos.xyz:8443 VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://erss-api.astrikos.xyz:8443 npm run build
VITE_API_URL=
VITE_SOCKET_URL=
VITE_OSRM_URL=https://router.project-osrm.org
VITE_MAP_STYLE=https://basemaps.cartocdn.com/gl/dark-matter-gl-style/style.json
VITE_MAP_STYLE_LIGHT=https://basemaps.cartocdn.com/gl/positron-gl-style/style.json
